New in 0.3.3 (19 October 2026): GFOpenTLS only. AmiSSL is no longer used or
needed, and GFOpenMail is built with GFOpenAmigaGCC 16.2.0-open2. An error
from GFOpenTLS ends with one full stop, not two.

New in 0.3.2 (10 October 2026): secure connections through GFOpenTLS
(gfopentls.library), the GFOpen family's own TLS, so mail works without AmiSSL;
AmiSSL 5 is used only when GFOpenTLS isn't installed and GFOpenMail was built
with it.

New in 0.3.1 (10 October 2026): the window first opens at 800 x 600, in
the middle of the space beside GFOpenDock (or all of that space on a smaller
screen), and the toolbar starts with icons only, as in every GFOpen app. A
size you give the window is kept. Settings > Toolbar still chooses icons
and text, or text only.
